--   Scheduled Job    Contracts — Copy Renewal Terms to Subscriptions (daily), running that action
--                    at 01:30 UTC. Ships Active, as the metadata states and as the hourly
--                    renewal-outcome job did in v0.12.
--
-- CREATE-ONLY: each create is guarded on its ID or its natural key (action Name + CategoryID;
-- job Name), and the push log's update branches are cut, so a host that pauses the job or edits
